  "title": "Gaocheng Astronomical Observatory",
  "summary": "The Yuan-dynasty observatory at Gaocheng town near Dengfeng, Henan, is credited to the astronomer Guo Shoujing. Its platform carries instruments for measuring the noon shadow of the sun through the year. The site is part of the Historic Monuments of Dengfeng, inscribed on the World Heritage List in July 2010.",
